==Strategy==
For 4-star, the [[Count Owlbrow|Count Owlbrows]] are highly magnified so it will take level 40 legend cats such as [[Crazed Bahamut Cat|Crazed Bahamut]], [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun]], and [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Mina]] in order to meet minimum score requirements.

It takes about 4 meatshields to stall out the [[Count Owlbrow|Count Owlbrows]] to the point where basically no ground is lost as long as there is sufficient DPS to kill the black units that appear. After the last [[Dark Otter]] dies, the enemy will be unable to gain ground. Allowing the back-liners to generally remain untouched.

Bring a spammable AoE attacker such as [[Courier Cat]] to help with peon waves. The peon waves provide sufficient money to be spent on constant spam.

